{\f1\fs28 LUMEN 1.0.0 RC1 - RELEASE CANDIDATE TERMS}\par
\par
Last updated: 11 September 2026\par
\par
Please read these terms before installing Lumen.\par
\par
{\f1 1. Release Candidate Software}\par
Lumen 1.0.0 RC1 is pre-release software provided for testing and evaluation. Features may change, fail, or behave unexpectedly.\par
\par
{\f1 2. Use}\par
You may install and use Lumen on computers you own or control. Lumen is intended to connect to a Jellyfin server that you are authorised to use.\par
\par
{\f1 3. Jellyfin and Third-Party Services}\par
Lumen is an independent Jellyfin client. Jellyfin and any third-party services used by Lumen remain subject to their own terms, availability, and privacy policies.\par
\par
{\f1 4. Downloads and Local Data}\par
Lumen can store downloaded media, application settings, cached artwork, playback information, and lyric timing data on this PC. Removing Lumen does not automatically remove media or data stored outside the application installation folder.\par
\par
{\f1 5. Lyrics and AutoSync}\par
Lyrics features may query supported online lyric services. Lyrics AutoSync uses a local Whisper model supplied with Lumen to analyse audio on this PC.\par
\par
{\f1 6. No Warranty}\par
This release candidate is provided as-is, without warranty. You are responsible for keeping backups of any data that matters to you.\par
\par
{\f1 7. Feedback}\par
Testing feedback, bug reports, and compatibility reports are welcome and may be used to improve future Lumen releases.\par
\par
By selecting I Agree and continuing, you acknowledge that you are installing pre-release software and accept these release candidate terms.\par
